<title>UK: LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</title>
<headline>LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Reuter - Following are the buying and selling rates for leading world currencies and gold against the dollar on the London foreign exchange and bullion markets today.</p>
<p>US$1.00 COSTS    1.3912/17  Canadian Dollars</p>
<p>		     1.8441/51  German Marks</p>
<p>		     2.0775/80  Dutch Guilders</p>
<p>		     1.5224/34  Swiss Francs</p>
<p>		     38.08/12   Belgian Francs</p>
<p>		     6.2185/95  French Francs</p>
<p>		     1803.4/3.9 Italian Lire</p>
<p>		     117.32/42  Japanese Yen</p>
<p>		     8.0404/79  Swedish Crowns</p>
<p>		     7.6449/99  Norwegian Crowns</p>
<p>		     7.0243/63  Danish Crowns</p>
<p>One sterling     US$1.5858/68</p>
<p>Gold (ounce)     US$326.20/70</p>
</text>
